like, oh, my God, there's no way they don't know what they had for lunch.
天哪，他们肯定知道对方午饭吃了什么。

937
00:39:08.100 --> 00:39:09.640
Because that is some close talking.
因为那贴得实在太近了。

938
00:39:10.160 --> 00:39:12.680
Well, when Jim lifts Pam up at the dojo.
那么，当吉姆在道场抱起帕姆的时候。

939
00:39:12.920 --> 00:39:14.780
At 14 minutes, 11 seconds.
在14分11秒处。

