我也有问题，快说吧。

942
00:39:19.780 --> 00:39:23.840
Well, in Office Olympics, Angela has her bit about Pam Pong.
在“办公室奥运会”那集里，安吉拉有个关于“帕姆乒乓”的桥段。

943
00:39:24.020 --> 00:39:24.380
Yes.
没错。

944
00:39:24.560 --> 00:39:28.360
And that's kind of the first time that Pam is made aware
那是帕姆第一次意识到，

945
00:39:28.360 --> 00:39:30.040
that someone else is aware.
有人注意到了他们。

946
00:39:30.240 --> 00:39:31.360
People are noticing.
大家都在看。

947
00:39:31.360 --> 00:39:31.900
Yes.
是的。

948
00:39:32.300 --> 00:39:39.320
And now, in this scene, Meredith clocks the interaction between Pam and Jim.
而现在，在这场戏里，梅雷迪斯看穿了帕姆和吉姆之间的互动。

