而且你能看到你的肚子。

952
00:39:44.480 --> 00:39:50.200
Now, I remember as your friend that week, you saying to me, oh, my gosh, oh, my gosh,
我记得那一周作为你的朋友，你跟我说，天哪，天哪，

953
00:39:50.680 --> 00:39:51.860
people are going to see my belly.
大家会看到我的肚子。

954
00:39:52.040 --> 00:39:54.460
Because it said, you know, it picks up and your shirt kind of comes up.
因为你知道，它会往上提，你的衬衫就会卷起来。

955
00:39:54.540 --> 00:39:55.740
And you were nervous about it.
你当时为此很紧张。

956
00:39:55.800 --> 00:39:55.980
Yeah.
是啊。

957
00:39:57.060 --> 00:39:58.580
So that was a fan question.
所以这是一个粉丝提问。

958
00:39:58.580 --> 00:40:02.100
Anthony asked, was it meant for your shirt to pull up when Jim lifted you?
安东尼问，吉姆抱起你的时候，衬衫卷起来是故意的吗？

959
00:40:02.200 --> 00:40:04.400
Or did it happen on accident and you went with it?
还是意外发生的，然后你就顺势演下去了？

960
00:40:04.520 --> 00:40:07.880
It was in the script that my shirt would come up a little bit.
剧本里确实写了我的衬衫会往上卷一点。

961
00:40:08.000 --> 00:40:14.040
And that was all to make it even more of a vulnerable thing for Pam.
这一切都是为了让帕姆显得更加脆弱。

962
00:40:14.200 --> 00:40:16.360
That she was literally exposed.
让她处于一种完全暴露的状态。

963
00:40:16.760 --> 00:40:16.900
Yeah.
没错。

964
00:40:17.000 --> 00:40:18.920
Something that you were really embarrassed about.
那是你当时真的很尴尬的事情。

965
00:40:18.920 --> 00:40:19.400
Yes.
是的。

966
00:40:19.620 --> 00:40:22.420
And wow, I wish my stomach looked like that today.
天哪，真希望我现在的肚子看起来还能那样。

967
00:40:22.940 --> 00:40:24.500
I watched that scene.
我看了那一幕。

968
00:40:24.720 --> 00:40:31.260
I was like, why was I not wearing midriff tops every day when I looked like that?
我当时想，我那时候肚子长那样，为什么不每天都穿露脐装呢？

969
00:40:31.460 --> 00:40:32.100
I know.
我知道。

970
00:40:32.220 --> 00:40:33.440
