而且，我是说，珍娜，你今天看起来棒极了。

974
00:40:41.740 --> 00:40:42.680
You look phenomenal then.
你当时看起来也棒极了。

975
00:40:42.860 --> 00:40:45.940
But I know, I remember our bellies before babies.
但我知道，我记得我们生孩子前的肚子。

976
00:40:45.940 --> 00:40:46.560
I remember.
我记得。

977
00:40:46.560 --> 00:40:51.300
Well, I am kind of glad that it was scripted that you see my belly.
好吧，我其实挺庆幸剧本里写了要露出我的肚子。

978
00:40:51.420 --> 00:40:53.380
Because I've got it on film now.
因为我现在有影像记录了。

979
00:40:53.560 --> 00:40:57.780
That at one time in my life, I had a cute little belly and belly button.
证明我生命中曾有过可爱的小肚子和肚脐。

980
00:40:58.060 --> 00:41:00.180
So thank you, Jean and Lee, for that.
所以谢谢你们，吉恩和李。

981
00:41:00.860 --> 00:41:05.180
At 13 minutes, 56 seconds, that's my third time code, Angela.
在13分56秒，这是我的第三个时间码，安吉拉。

982
00:41:05.660 --> 00:41:10.380
There is a poster in the background of this interaction between Jim and Pam.
在吉姆和帕姆互动的背景里有一张海报。

983
00:41:10.520 --> 00:41:12.460
So we're all watching Jim and Pam.
我们都在看吉姆和帕姆。

984
00:41:12.620 --> 00:41:15.380
But in the background, there is a poster on the wall.
但在背景里，墙上有一张海报。

985
00:41:15.380 --> 00:41:17.780
And it is one of my favorite things.
那是我最喜欢的东西之一。

986
00:41:18.000 --> 00:41:21.520
It was like a favorite thing of all of us when we got to the dojo.
当我们到达道场时，那是我们所有人都很喜欢的东西。

987
00:41:21.640 --> 00:41:28.780
This was a set decoration poster that Jean and Lee wrote that set decoration had printed and put on the wall.
这是一张布景海报，是吉恩和李写的，布景组把它打印出来贴在了墙上。

988
00:41:28.900 --> 00:41:31.440
It is the 10 rules of karate.
那是空手道的十条准则。

989
00:41:31.800 --> 00:41:32.260
Okay.
好的。

990
00:41:32.640 --> 00:41:33.020
All right.
好吧。

991
00:41:33.240 --> 00:41:34.980
According to this dojo.
根据这个道场的规定。

992
00:41:35.260 --> 00:41:36.760
And I'm going to read them to you.
我要读给你们听。

993
00:41:36.860 --> 00:41:37.160
Okay.
好的。

994
00:41:37.580 --> 00:41:38.260
They're amazing.
它们太棒了。

995
00:41:38.260 --> 00:41:41.200
Number one, obey your parents.
第一条，听从父母的话。

996
00:41:41.540 --> 00:41:42.000
Okay.
好的。

997
00:41:42.240 --> 00:41:44.280
Number two, no junk food.
第二条，不吃垃圾食品。

998
00:41:44.680 --> 00:41:46.960
Number three, do your homework.
第三条，完成家庭作业。

999
00:41:47.500 --> 00:41:49.980
Number four, keep your room clean.
第四条，保持房间整洁。

1000
00:41:50.420 --> 00:41:53.560
Number five, maintain an indomitable spirit.
第五条，保持不屈不挠的精神。

1001
00:41:54.260 --> 00:41:56.700
Number six, don't fight with your siblings.
第六条，不要和兄弟姐妹打架。

1002
00:41:57.300 --> 00:42:00.380
Seven, practice, practice, practice.
第七条，练习，练习，再练习。

1003
00:42:01.160 --> 00:42:04.300
Eight, treat others the way you would like to be treated.
第八条，己所欲，施于人。

1004
00:42:04.300 --> 00:42:07.020
Nine, be loyal to your country.
第九条，忠于你的国家。

1005
00:42:07.320 --> 00:42:09.080
And ten, have fun.
第十条，玩得开心。

1006
00:42:09.760 --> 00:42:12.660
So Lee told me he still has this poster.
李告诉我他现在还留着这张海报。

1007
00:42:12.660 --> 00:42:13.680
He asked to have it.
他当时想要这张海报。

1008
00:42:13.840 --> 00:42:16.400
He said they spent way too long writing these rules.
他说他们写这些规则花的时间太长了。

1009
00:42:16.400 --> 00:42:18.740
I was going to say, I bet they spent like hours.
我正想说，我敢打赌他们肯定花了好几个小时。

1010
00:42:19.000 --> 00:42:19.840
They did.
确实如此。

1011
00:42:20.020 --> 00:42:21.240
Like cracking themselves up.
就像是把自己逗乐了一样。

1012
00:42:21.360 --> 00:42:30.560
It's amazing to me because I feel like it is this little detail that really hammers home that Dwight takes classes in a studio meant for children.
这让我觉得很神奇，因为我觉得正是这个小细节，有力地说明了德怀特是在一个为孩子们准备的练习室里上课。

1013
00:42:31.200 --> 00:42:32.040
Do your homework.
做你的家庭作业。

1014
00:42:32.040 --> 00:42:34.080
These are kid-based rules.
这些都是基于儿童的规则。

1015
00:42:34.420 --> 00:42:36.100
And of course, you see that.
当然，你也能看出来。

1016
00:42:36.220 --> 00:42:39.020
You see that he's in a class with a bunch of 11-year-olds.
你看到他和一群11岁的孩子一起上课。

1017
00:42:39.200 --> 00:42:42.240
But I just think that is brilliant.
但我只是觉得这太天才了。

1018
00:42:42.420 --> 00:42:43.820
Brilliant writing that poster.
写那张海报的剧本太天才了。

1019
00:42:44.180 --> 00:42:44.660
Okay.
好的。

1020
00:42:44.700 --> 00:42:48.180
So that was their version of the rules of karate, right?
所以那是他们版本的空手道规则，对吧？

1021
00:42:48.420 --> 00:42:50.320
There's this thread on Reddit where people go back and forth.
Reddit上有一个帖子，人们在上面争论不休。

1022
00:42:50.460 --> 00:42:51.620
They were like, but Dwight says karate.
他们说，但德怀特说的是空手道。

1023
00:42:51.620 --> 00:42:52.980
And then there's taekwondo this.
然后又说这是跆拳道。

1024
00:42:52.980 --> 00:42:53.940
And there's this and this.
还有这个那个的。

1025
00:42:54.020 --> 00:42:57.580
So a little bit that the martial arts didn't quite line up in that dojo.
所以那个道场里的武术种类有点对不上号。

1026
00:42:57.920 --> 00:42:58.360
Yeah.
没错。

1027
00:42:58.540 --> 00:43:00.260
