我是说，德怀特可能并没有在学习任何一种纯粹的武术。

1029
00:43:06.820 --> 00:43:07.020
Right.
对。

1030
00:43:07.220 --> 00:43:13.760
I have to talk about the fact that at 14 minutes, 11 seconds, I think that Pam is sending Jim mixed signals.
我必须得提一下，在14分11秒的时候，我觉得帕姆在给吉姆发混合信号。

1031
00:43:14.200 --> 00:43:15.160
Of course she is.
她当然是在发混合信号。

1032
00:43:15.160 --> 00:43:16.980
And I totally judged her a little bit.
而且我确实稍微评判了她一下。

1033
00:43:17.080 --> 00:43:17.460
I know.
我知道。

1034
00:43:17.460 --> 00:43:19.060
Because she was being really flirty.
因为她当时表现得真的很轻浮。

1035
00:43:19.220 --> 00:43:23.640
And then when Meredith noticed, it wasn't until Meredith noticed.
然后当梅雷迪思注意到的时候，直到梅雷迪思注意到。

1036
00:43:23.640 --> 00:43:24.120
That's right.
没错。

1037
00:43:24.260 --> 00:43:25.960
That then she pushed Jim away.
她才把吉姆推开。

1038
00:43:25.960 --> 00:43:33.280
And then the look on John's face, he does such a fantastic job of looking wounded and confused.
然后约翰脸上的表情，他把那种受伤和困惑的神情演得太棒了。

1039
00:43:33.680 --> 00:43:34.180
And not really.
其实并没有。

1040
00:43:34.300 --> 00:43:35.320
He was so happy.
他当时很高兴。

1041
00:43:35.440 --> 00:43:36.800
But now he's like, now what happened?
但现在他就像是，现在发生什么了？

1042
00:43:37.880 --> 00:43:39.400
He did such a great job.
他演得太好了。

1043
00:43:39.520 --> 00:43:41.280
Because Pam is sending him mixed signals.
因为帕姆在给他发混合信号。

1044
00:43:41.460 --> 00:43:42.280
She really is.
她确实在发。

1045
00:43:42.280 --> 00:43:45.640
But I mean, that's complicated, unrequited love for you.
但我的意思是，这就是复杂的单相思。

1046
00:43:45.820 --> 00:43:46.240
I know.
我知道。

1047
00:43:46.420 --> 00:43:47.160
What are you going to do?
你能怎么办呢？

1048
00:43:47.380 --> 00:43:48.560
She's conflicted.
她很矛盾。

1049
00:43:48.660 --> 00:43:49.640
She's conflicted.
她很矛盾。

1050
00:43:49.740 --> 00:43:59.560
When Michael pins down Dwight at the dojo and is winning the fight, our director of photography, Randall Einhorn, who used to work on Survivor.
当迈克尔在道场里压制住德怀特并赢得比赛时，我们的摄影指导兰德尔·艾因霍恩，他以前在《幸存者》剧组工作。

1051
00:43:59.560 --> 00:44:02.740
So I want to say, literally nothing surprises this man.
所以我想说，真的没有什么能让这个人感到惊讶。

1052
00:44:02.740 --> 00:44:03.640
He is a total pro.
他是个绝对的专业人士。

1053
00:44:03.820 --> 00:44:04.580
He never broke.
他从没笑场过。

1054
00:44:05.000 --> 00:44:06.640
He lost it.
他破功了。

1055
00:44:07.200 --> 00:44:08.260
He lost it.
他破功了。

1056
00:44:08.340 --> 00:44:15.300
He was laughing so hard that he had to take the camera off his shoulder and hold it out with his arm so that it wouldn't shake.
他笑得太厉害了，不得不把摄像机从肩上拿下来，用手臂伸出去举着，才不会晃动。

1057
00:44:15.520 --> 00:44:19.320
He had tears streaming down his face.
他泪流满面。

1058
00:44:19.940 --> 00:44:21.780
It's the hardest I've ever seen him laugh.
那是我见过他笑得最厉害的一次。

1059
00:44:22.060 --> 00:44:22.440
Yeah.
没错。

1060
00:44:22.600 --> 00:44:24.920
That's saying something because he was like a statue.
这可不简单，因为他平时就像尊雕像一样。

1061
00:44:25.100 --> 00:44:27.080
Him and Oscar Nunez never break.
他和奥斯卡·努涅斯从来不会笑场。

1062
00:44:27.260 --> 00:44:27.440
Yeah.
没错。

1063
00:44:27.580 --> 00:44:28.800
I have a question for you.
我有个问题想问你。

1064
00:44:28.800 --> 00:44:35.900
Lance, when I was speaking to him, said to his knowledge the fight was not choreographed and that he really believed that the stuff that Michael,
兰斯跟我说，据他所知那场打斗并没有编排过，他真的相信迈克尔，

1065
00:44:36.200 --> 00:44:43.240
that Steve was doing to Rain as Dwight, like holding him down and trying to spit on him and all of that, that Steve improvised that.
也就是史蒂夫对雷恩（饰演德怀特）做的那些事，比如把他按住、试图朝他吐口水之类的，都是史蒂夫即兴发挥的。

1066
00:44:43.540 --> 00:44:45.040
I asked Lee about that.
我问过李这件事。

1067
00:44:45.160 --> 00:44:51.420
His memory is that they did bring in a stunt coordinator to work with them on set one day during a break.
他的记忆是，他们确实在某天休息时请了一位特技指导到现场和他们一起工作。

1068
00:44:51.560 --> 00:44:51.740
Yeah.
没错。

1069
00:44:51.880 --> 00:44:53.260
So Lance wouldn't have been there for that.
所以兰斯当时可能不在场。

1070
00:44:53.420 --> 00:44:53.920
That's right.
没错。

1071
00:44:54.100 --> 00:44:54.640
And so.
所以。

1072
00:44:55.040 --> 00:44:57.120
But that person did not go to the dojo.
但那个人并没有去道场。

1073
00:44:57.380 --> 00:44:57.960
Did not go to the dojo.
没去道场。

1074
00:44:57.960 --> 00:45:00.280
On the day that you actually did it, they were not present.
在你们真正拍摄的那天，他们不在场。

1075
00:45:00.620 --> 00:45:08.740
And so on the day, he said they just, like Steve and Rain and Ken Kwapis just came up with a bunch of stuff, like the typewriter stuff.
所以那天他说，史蒂夫、雷恩和肯·夸皮斯只是想出了一堆点子，比如打字机那段。

1076
00:45:08.940 --> 00:45:09.200
Mm-hmm.
嗯。

1077
00:45:09.200 --> 00:45:13.100
And just, he said, he doesn't remember how many takes they did, but it was a lot.
他说他不记得拍了多少条，但确实拍了很多次。

1078
00:45:13.180 --> 00:45:18.000
